          "p": "Tuesday, October 14, 2025"
        },
        {
          "p": "5:30 – 8:00pm"
        },
        {
          "p": "Community Hall – Room B"
        },
        {
          "p": "In Attendance:\tPat Delgado, Lee Moreau, Quinn Harlow (proxy for Ari Stone), Dana Whitfield (Monitoring WG Chair), Ellis Novak (Program Coordinator), Fern Castillo (Minute Recorder)"
        },
        {
          "p": "Regrets:\tGray Holm, Ivy Mendez"
        },
        {
          "p": "Guests:\tJules Park (Regional Ministry), Kit Rowan (Valley Times)"
        },
        {
          "p": "1) REVIEW AND ADOPT MINUTES OF LAST MEETING"
        },
        {
          "li": "Minutes approved with changes noted"
        },
        {
          "p": "2) FUNDING"
        },
        {
          "p": "A resolution was motioned by Lee Moreau, seconded by Pat Delgado, and adopted by consensus by all directors present, that the grant agreement with the Regional Ministry be approved and signed by two authorized signatories."
        },
        {
          "p": "3) NEW BUSINESS"
        },
        {
          "p": "a) Motion: Lakeside adopt the transit recommendation of the task force report"
        },
        {
          "li": "The recommendation is ambiguous and requires clarification"
        },
        {
          "li": "Discussion tabled to next meeting"
        },
        {
          "p": "b) Road dust study – the ministry is not the owner of the road; will research ownership maps"
        },
        {
          "p": "\t\t\tAction: Pat, Lee"
        },
        {
          "p": "\t\t\tAction: Ellis to send the council report"
        },
        {
          "p": "Next meeting date and time:  Tuesday, November 18, 2025 – 5:30 PM"
        },
        {
          "p": "Location:  Northport Library, Room 2"
        }
      ],
